  <!-- 4 Core Pillars of VDM Engineering -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: 4.5rem 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Indian Fabricators Rely on the CyTOS VDM Series</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Designed from the ground up for continuous industrial duty, heavy metal chip loads, and maximum cycle time reduction.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="workflow-card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
          <div style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">⚙️</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-pure);">Simultaneous Multi-Spindle Output</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
            Configured with dual or triple synchronized drilling/milling heads. Produce 2 to 3 identical electrical panel cutouts or hole patterns in a single pass, slashing production cycle times by up to 65%.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
          <div style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">💪</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-pure);">High-Torque BT30 / BT40 Spindles</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
            Unlike high-speed routing spindles, VDM spindles are engineered for low-end torque (100 to 6,000 RPM) allowing rigid drilling up to 32 mm diameter and thread tapping up to M16 in solid mild steel.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
          <div style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🛡️</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-pure);">Heavy Damped Cast Iron Bed</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
            Heavy stress-relieved Meehanite grade cast iron bed ensures high vibration absorption during interrupted cuts, delivering mirror surface finishes and preventing tool chatter or premature carbide chipping.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

